<p>{{ site.name }} is a free news site. This page explains how it may earn money and how that is kept apart from the reporting.</p>
<h2>Today</h2>
<p>The site does not show ads, does not carry sponsored posts and does not use affiliate links today.</p>
<h2>If that changes</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Display ads.</strong> We may later show ads served by an advertising partner. Ads will be visibly separate from articles, and the <a href="{{ '/privacy/' | url }}">privacy policy</a> will name the partner and its cookies before any ad code runs.</li>
  <li><strong>Sponsored content.</strong> Anything paid for will be labeled “Sponsored” at the top.</li>
  <li><strong>Affiliate links.</strong> If a link earns a commission, the article will say so near the link.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Editorial independence</h2>
<p>Advertisers and partners do not choose, review or change our stories. No team, driver, promoter or series pays for coverage. {{ site.disclaimerLine }}</p>
<p>This disclosure follows the Federal Trade Commission’s <a href="https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/ftcs-endorsement-guides-what-people-are-asking">Endorsement Guides</a>.</p>
<p>Questions go through the <a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">contact form</a>. We do not publish a street address.</p>
